{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-extracttablemetatfeatures-tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: ExtractTableMeta<TFeatures, TData>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type ExtractTableMeta<TFeatures, TData> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? TableMeta<TFeatures, TData> : TFeatures extends object ? TMeta : TableMeta<TFeatures, TData>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts#L30","children":[{"type":"text","value":"core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts:30"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resolves the type of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options.meta"},{"type":"text","value":" for a feature set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When the features object declares a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" type-only slot\n("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableFeatures({ ..., tableMeta: {} as MyTableMeta })"},{"type":"text","value":"), that type wins.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableMeta"},{"type":"text","value":"\ninterface."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"RowData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-extracttablemetatfeatures-tdata","text":"Type Alias: ExtractTableMeta<TFeatures, TData>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: ExtractTableMeta\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractTableMeta<TFeatures, TData> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? TableMeta<TFeatures, TData> : TFeatures extends object ? TMeta : TableMeta<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts#L30)\n\nResolves the type of `options.meta` for a feature set.\n\nWhen the features object declares a `tableMeta` type-only slot\n(`tableFeatures({ ..., tableMeta: {} as MyTableMeta })`), that type wins.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged `TableMeta`\ninterface.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](RowData.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ExtractTableMeta\ntitle: ExtractTableMeta\n---\n\n# Type Alias: ExtractTableMeta\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractTableMeta<TFeatures, TData> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? TableMeta<TFeatures, TData> : TFeatures extends object ? TMeta : TableMeta<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/core/table/coreTablesFeature.types.ts#L30)\n\nResolves the type of `options.meta` for a feature set.\n\nWhen the features object declares a `tableMeta` type-only slot\n(`tableFeatures({ ..., tableMeta: {} as MyTableMeta })`), that type wins.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged `TableMeta`\ninterface.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](RowData.md)\n"}
